Theorem HAUSDIST_FRONTIERS_CONVEX : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall s t c= R :^: idx N, convex N s /\ (convex N t /\ (bounded_hl N s /\ bounded_hl N t)) -> hausdist N (frontier N s,frontier N t) = hausdist N (s,t).
Admitted.

