Theorem CHOOSE_SURROUNDING_SIMPLEX_FULL : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall a :e R :^: idx N, exists s c= R :^: idx N, simplex N (dimindex N) s /\ a :e interior N s.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/polytope.ml:7644 / CHOOSE_POLYTOPE
